  )

  (text_box "SGC P1 - ANNA-B402 carrier, 22x55 mm 4-layer (0.8 mm, ENIG) - rev A-WIP - 2026-10-29
Generated from sgc_schematic_spec.md v0.1 (92b352e). Every pin/net traceable to the spec;
TBD-JP items appear as notes only - nothing invented. Regenerate: python3 gen_symbols.py && python3 gen_schematic.py"
    (at 140 14 0) (size 165 12)
    (stroke (width 0.0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 86e948db-a031-4181-997f-a8e8460d7220)
  )
  (text_box "ANTENNA KEEPOUT (SIM UBX-21000517 App.B p.70): no traces/vias in ANY layer in the antenna strip clearance area.
Internal antenna: ANT_INT(5)-ANT(6) bridge. Corner placement -> ANT_PCB(1) = GND pattern, ANT_GND1/2 (2,3) NC.
Stackup must be checked vs u-blox reference (certification). Keep U8/IS31 clear of antenna strip (IS31 ds EMI note)."
    (at 160 72 0) (size 132 17)
    (stroke (width 0.0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 96586cac-12ee-45c8-8875-ca7d452df4d7)
  )
  (text_box "CHARGER (spec 4.1/4.7): ISET 1.82k -> ICHG ~110 mA; ILIM 1k -> 200 mA; IPRETERM 4.99k -> 10%; VBATREG default 4.2 V.
OD-8: /CD -> P0.08 (B402 pin 50, moved from P0.25 - P0.25 does not exist) + 100k PU to V_PMID (ship-mode capable).
BQ INT -> 100k PU +1V8, NC on MCU (read FAULTS reg, AD-029); /PG TP only. /MR, RESET NC (Nicla P0.18->MR net dropped, C3).
LS/LDO unused (C4): LSCTRL->GND, VINLS->SYS, LS/LDO 1uF. TS: R_HI (VBUS->TS) + R_LO (TS->GND) + pack NTC - values TBD-JP (OD-4).
i2c0 pull-ups 100k to +1V8 (Nicla parity; BQ ds suggests 10k - spec chose Nicla parity). USB-IF inrush note OD-14."
    (at 15 104 0) (size 132 26)
    (stroke (width 0.0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 98bbfcf1-4331-4122-9efc-e88d32360a7c)
  )
  (text_box "USB-C: VBUS 10uF bulk at connector; D+/D- NC; shell stitched to GND.
ESD D5 TBD-JP (OD-13: PESD5V0U2UT vs TPD4E05U06)."
    (at 15 86 0) (size 40 14)
    (stroke (width 0.0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 63237233-9ba4-4334-b659-bef9ecaa5560)
  )
  (text_box "GAUGE (spec 4.2, AD-029): addr 0x36 fixed; VDD(3)=VBAT sense +0.1uF; CELL(2) NC->GND; CTG/QSTRT->GND.
ALRT(5) OD -> 10k PU +1V8 -> P0.21 (B402 pin 26). OD-12: verify MAX17048 VIH vs 1.8 V pull-ups at review."
    (at 15 176 0) (size 44 16)
    (stroke (width 0.0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 9e099ff6-1b9e-414a-9d20-88eeb3795961)
  )
  (text_box "I2C MAP (spec 2):
i2c0 power bus P0.15/P0.16 (PU 100k -> +1V8): 0x36 MAX17048, 0x53 IS31FL3194, 0x6A BQ25120A.
i2c1 sensor bus P0.22/P0.23: 0x2A LDC1612 (DNP v2), 0x52 RV-3028-C7 (DNP v2, /INT -> TP)."
    (at 240 185 0) (size 68 24)
    (stroke (width 0.0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 06c22529-c468-4b02-8b49-bde70c35a565)
  )
  (text_box "BHI CLUSTER (spec 4.4): BMP390L/BMM150/BME688 are sub-sensors on BHI M1 master port - exact M1/M2/M3 wiring = COPY
ABX00050 (Nicla) at capture (TBD-JP). BME688 DNP per OD-6 (footprint retained). H-IF SPI 16 MHz (app.overlay) on
P0.03-05 despite Table 4 low-freq remark - risk R1: drop to 8/4 MHz if RF regressions. RESETN -> P0.13 (moved, C3/OD-7).
HOSTBOOT(3) NC v1 (TBD-JP vs Nicla); VREG(6) NC v1 (decoupling per Bosch ds - TBD-JP, not in spec 6); RESV1-3 NC (do not connect)."
    (at 282 100 0) (size 122 22)
    (stroke (width 0.0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 86d492f2-09e7-4e46-a1b8-8d11aa4a2efe)
  )
  (text_box "LED (spec 4.3): U5 VCC/SDB -> V_PMID (OD-17: confirm SDB net on ABX00050 at capture); decap value TBD-JP.
IS31 OUT1-3 are current sinks - verify SMLP34RGB2W3 common polarity at capture (spec text says anodes to OUTs)."
    (at 352 148 0) (size 48 16)
    (stroke (width 0.0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 5b075b1e-3d1d-4750-b7cf-72a17091f48c)
  )
  (text_box "FLASH: U7 = RawRunStore 8 MB (flash layout per hardware doc). U2 = BHI FW flash (Arduino_BHY2 upload) -
OD-5: ADD U2 to BOM (Nicla parity, populated; missing from BOM v4.3). WP#/HOLD# NC -> internal PU (Macronix Note 1).
U7/U2 decap 100n = Nicla parity (TBD-JP keep, spec 6)."
    (at 352 196 0) (size 48 22)
    (stroke (width 0.0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 5d94883d-8c88-4112-a69b-6fa51f3514f7)
  )
  (text_box "PERIPHERALS / v2 DNP (spec 2/4.3/4.6/4.8):
SK6812-mini x5 strip: DIN <- P0.19 (B402 pin 38) through dual-supply level translator (VCCA +1V8 / VCCB +5V,
TXB0102/TXS0102-class - part TBD-JP, OD-9). Strip supply +5V from MT3608 boost (EN -> P0.17 = B402 pin 49, moved
from P0.24 - does not exist; OD-9b: keep P0.19 vs move to full-drive GPIO - decide after R2 bench).
Boost BOM (hw doc 7.3): L 4.7uH/2A, Cin 10uF, Cout 22uF, Rfb 75k/10k, Cff 22pF. NOT drawn - capture at layout.
32k: Y1 SIT1532AI (OD-10 default FIT) -> XL1 (pin 17); XL2 (18) -> GND; Y1 decap TBD-JP. LFRC-only = EVK alternative.
UART console TP: TX P0.20 (pin 10) / RX P0.09 (pin 22, NFC1 - no NFC coil on board). TP set per OD-3:
+1V8, +5V, VBAT, V_PMID, GND, BQ INT, SWD row, UART row, ALRT, LED-data.
DNP v2 (footprints retained): LDC1612 U6 + 14mm coil (ADDR=GND -> 0x2A; INTB -> BUTTON net per OD-11; CLKIN tie
GND if internal osc - v2), RV-3028-C7 @0x52 (/INT -> TP, no GPIO steal), BZ1 beeper (P0.09 via 100R/NPN).
nRF P0.24/P0.25 DO NOT EXIST on B402 (spec C1/C2 pin moves). Module USB (pins 21/34/35) unused - NC."
    (at 125 185 0) (size 105 46)
    (stroke (width 0.0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 6dfa28bc-4722-4f23-b2c7-1351995dd18c)
  )
  (text_box "BATTERY / POWER TREE (spec 4.8/5): Renata ICP622540PMT 600 mAh 3.7 V LiPo, 3-wire NTC pack, JST-3 user-replaceable
(connector PN TBD-JP, OD-4; pinout per ABX00050 = VBAT/NTC/GND). VSYS is the +1V8 rail (buck default 1.8 V, 300 mA).
VBAT -> MAX17048 VDD only. V_PMID -> IS31FL3194. Charge 110 mA + system ~25 mA + LED ~23 mA bat-side = 158 mA < ILIM 200 mA.
Session ~48 mAh -> ~12.5 sessions (hw doc 7); gauge adds ~3 uA (AD-029). Battery capacity 600 mAh per docs (OD-4 confirm)."
    (at 15 216 0) (size 110 30)
    (stroke (width 0.0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 55b0db45-a411-4486-b7c3-2f4fcca90446)
  )
  (text_box "J3 = ARM Cortex Debug 2x5 1.27 mm: 1 VTref(+1V8) 2 SWDIO 3 GND 4 SWDCLK 5 GND 6 SWO 7 KEY-NC 8 TDI-NC 9 GND 10 nRESET(=RESET_N, B402 pin 12 - nothing else on pin 12 except TP).
OD-2: Tag-Connect TC2050 footprint alternative (castellated pads). SWO = B402 pin 16 (optional)."
    (at 15 274 0) (size 92 14)
    (stroke (width 0.0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid c33d3251-00e8-4ef0-afd3-c807551ee5c8)
  )
  (text_box "U6 LDC1612 = DNP v2 footprint (unpopulated v1, spec 1/4.6). Coil = 14 mm spiral on CH0 (footprint retained, v2)."
    (at 196 240 0) (size 52 16)
    (stroke (width 0.0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid cff436cc-0799-4c87-8737-3acc003f54e2)
  )

